---
import SiteLayout from '../layouts/SiteLayout.astro';
---

<SiteLayout title="Privacy | next roll">
  <section class="page">
    <h1>Privacy,<br />plainly.</h1>
    <p class="page-intro">next roll is a local film notebook. The app does not collect your camera, roll or film-fridge data.</p>
    <div class="prose">
      <h2>Your data stays on your phone</h2>
      <p>Camera names, film rolls, notes, dates and fridge inventory are stored locally on your device. They are not uploaded to our servers or shared with us.</p>
      <h2>No account or advertising trackers</h2>
      <p>next roll does not require an account and does not use advertising trackers or data brokerage. We collect a small amount of anonymous usage data, such as app opens, feature use and website page views, to understand what is useful.</p>
      <h2>If you contact support</h2>
      <p>If you email us, we receive the information you choose to include in that message, such as your email address and support question. We use it only to reply.</p>
      <h2>Questions</h2>
      <p>For privacy questions, write to <a href="mailto:privacy@nextroll.app">privacy@nextroll.app</a>.</p>
      <p><small>Last updated: September 2026</small></p>
    </div>
  </section>
</SiteLayout>
